=== task: code medium
title: Remove All Occurrences of a Substring
leetcode: 1910 | Remove All Occurrences of a Substring | remove-all-occurrences-of-a-substring
patterns: build + count
prompt: `s` and `part` are already set. Remove the leftmost copy of `part` from `s`, again and again, until no copy is left; a removal can join two pieces into a new copy. Create `result`.

**Example 1:** if `s` is `"daabcbaabcbc"` and `part` is `"abc"`, `result` is `"dab"`.

**Example 2:** if `s` is `"axxxxyyyyb"` and `part` is `"xy"`, `result` is `"ab"`.

